| Safari  | ⚠ Partial |
| Firefox | ❌ No (no Web Speech API) |
---

## Mac desktop app

A standalone VoiceScript.app (no Chrome needed). In the app only **Offline**
mode works: Live mode relies on Chrome's speech service, which the app doesn't have.
The first transcription downloads the Whisper model (~145MB); after that it works offline.

Build it (needs Node.js):

```bash
npm install
npm run dist
```

- `dist/VoiceScript-1.0.0-arm64.dmg` — installer: open it and drag VoiceScript to Applications
- `dist/mac-arm64/VoiceScript.app` — the app itself
- `npm start` — run it without packaging, for quick testing

The app is self-signed, not notarized by Apple. On another Mac, right-click → **Open** the first time.
